{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45578","headline":"富贵曲二首 二 · 贯休","name":"富贵曲二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如神若仙，似兰同雪。\n乐戒于极，胡不知辍。\n只欲更缀上落花，恨不能把住明月。\n太山肉尽，东海酒竭。\n佳人醉唱，敲玉钗折。\n宁知耘田车水翁，日日日灸背欲裂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}